{
  "info": {
    "name": "Desafio Desenvolvedor API",
    "description": {
      "type": "text/markdown",
      "content": "# Desafio Desenvolvedor API\n\nCollection alinhada com o comportamento real do sistema.\n\n## Fluxo sugerido\n1. Execute `Obter CSRF Cookie`\n2. Execute `Login`\n3. Rode as requisicoes autenticadas de uploads e market data\n4. Execute `Logout`\n\n## Cobertura atual\n- `GET /sanctum/csrf-cookie`\n- `POST /api/auth/login`\n- `POST /api/auth/logout`\n- `POST /api/uploads`\n- `GET /api/uploads`\n- `GET /api/market-data`\n\n## Observacoes\n- autenticacao stateful com cookie de sessao\n- requisicoes mutaveis exigem `X-XSRF-TOKEN`\n- `POST /api/uploads` propaga `X-Request-Id`\n- uploads retornam `202 Accepted`\n- market data retorna payload paginado com e sem filtros\n"
    },
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "login_email",
      "value": "test@example.com",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "login_password",
      "value": "password",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "xsrf_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "request_id",
      "value": "req-postman-001",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "upload_file_path",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "upload_filename_filter",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "upload_reference_date",
      "value": "2026-03-20",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "uploads_per_page",
      "value": "10",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "market_ticker",
      "value": "003H11",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "market_report_date",
      "value": "2026-03-20",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "market_page",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "market_per_page",
      "value": "10",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "if (pm.request.method !== 'GET') {",
          "    var xsrfToken = pm.cookies.get('XSRF-TOKEN') || pm.environment.get('xsrf_token');",
          "    if (xsrfToken) {",
          "        pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-XSRF-TOKEN', value: decodeURIComponent(xsrfToken) });",
          "    }",
          "}",
          "",
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'Accept', value: 'application/json' });",
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-Requested-With', value: 'XMLHttpRequest' });"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Autenticacao",
      "description": "Fluxo stateful com CSRF e cookie de sessao.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Obter CSRF Cookie",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/sanctum/csrf-cookie",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "sanctum",
                "csrf-cookie"
              ]
            },
            "description": {
              "type": "text/markdown",
              "content": "Inicializa o fluxo stateful do Sanctum e grava os cookies `XSRF-TOKEN` e de sessao no cookie jar."
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code is 204', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(204);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "var xsrfToken = pm.cookies.get('XSRF-TOKEN');",
                  "if (xsrfToken) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('xsrf_token', decodeURIComponent(xsrfToken));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{login_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{login_password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": {
              "type": "text/markdown",
              "content": "Autentica o usuario seed local e abre a sessao stateful."
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code is 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Response contains authenticated user', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.data.user.email).to.eql(pm.environment.get('login_email'));",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.message).to.eql('Login realizado com sucesso.');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/logout",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "logout"
              ]
            },
            "description": {
              "type": "text/markdown",
              "content": "Encerra a sessao atual e renova o token CSRF da sessao."
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code is 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Response confirms logout', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.message).to.eql('Logout realizado com sucesso.');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Uploads",
      "description": "Recebimento de arquivo e consulta do historico operacional.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Criar Upload",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-Request-Id",
                "value": "{{request_id}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "file",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": "{{upload_file_path}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/uploads",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "uploads"
              ]
            },
            "description": {
              "type": "text/markdown",
              "content": "Envia um arquivo `csv`, `xls` ou `xlsx` para processamento assincrono."
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code is 202', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(202);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Upload payload includes request correlation', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.meta.request_id).to.eql(pm.environment.get('request_id'));",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('X-Request-Id')).to.eql(pm.environment.get('request_id'));",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.data.upload).to.have.property('status');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar Uploads",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/uploads?per_page={{uploads_per_page}}",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "uploads"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "per_page",
                  "value": "{{uploads_per_page}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": {
              "type": "text/markdown",
              "content": "Retorna o historico paginado de uploads."
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code is 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Response contains pagination metadata', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('data');",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.meta).to.have.property('current_page');",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.meta).to.have.property('per_page');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar Uploads Filtrados",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/uploads?per_page={{uploads_per_page}}&filename={{upload_filename_filter}}&date={{upload_reference_date}}",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "uploads"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "per_page",
                  "value": "{{uploads_per_page}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "filename",
                  "value": "{{upload_filename_filter}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "date",
                  "value": "{{upload_reference_date}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": {
              "type": "text/markdown",
              "content": "Consulta uploads filtrando por trecho de nome do arquivo e `reference_date`."
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code is 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Filtered response still has pagination metadata', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.meta).to.have.property('total');",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.meta).to.have.property('last_page');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Market Data",
      "description": "Consultas paginadas sobre market data processada.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar Market Data",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/market-data?page={{market_page}}&per_page={{market_per_page}}",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "market-data"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "{{market_page}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "per_page",
                  "value": "{{market_per_page}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": {
              "type": "text/markdown",
              "content": "Consulta paginada sem filtros. Esse e o cenario elegivel para cache."
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code is 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Response contains paginated market data payload', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('data');",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.meta).to.have.property('current_page');",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.meta).to.have.property('total');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Filtrar Por Ticker",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/market-data?TckrSymb={{market_ticker}}&page={{market_page}}&per_page={{market_per_page}}",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "market-data"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "TckrSymb",
                  "value": "{{market_ticker}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "{{market_page}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "per_page",
                  "value": "{{market_per_page}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": {
              "type": "text/markdown",
              "content": "Filtra market data por ticker normalizado."
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code is 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Filtered payload stays paginated', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.meta).to.have.property('per_page');",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.meta).to.have.property('last_page');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Filtrar Por Data",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/market-data?RptDt={{market_report_date}}&page={{market_page}}&per_page={{market_per_page}}",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "market-data"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "RptDt",
                  "value": "{{market_report_date}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "{{market_page}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "per_page",
                  "value": "{{market_per_page}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": {
              "type": "text/markdown",
              "content": "Filtra market data pela data de referencia no formato `Y-m-d`."
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code is 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Date filter response is valid', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('data');",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.meta).to.have.property('current_page');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Filtrar Por Ticker E Data",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/market-data?TckrSymb={{market_ticker}}&RptDt={{market_report_date}}&page={{market_page}}&per_page={{market_per_page}}",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "market-data"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "TckrSymb",
                  "value": "{{market_ticker}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "RptDt",
                  "value": "{{market_report_date}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "{{market_page}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "per_page",
                  "value": "{{market_per_page}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": {
              "type": "text/markdown",
              "content": "Combina filtros por ticker e data sem perder o envelope paginado."
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code is 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Combined filter response is paginated', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.meta).to.have.property('total');",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.meta).to.have.property('per_page');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
